items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\r\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\r\n                        <div><strong>Nitrogen Leak Testing:</strong> High-pressure checks to ensure a permanent seal for your <a href=\"/gas-charging-service/\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium hover:underline\">Gas Charging Service</a>.</div>\r\n                    </li>\r\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\r\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\r\n                        <div><strong>Deep Dehydration:</strong> We use industrial vacuum pumps to reach 500 microns, essential for long-term compressor health in Saurashtra&#8217;s climate.</div>\r\n                    </li>\r\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\r\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg>\r\n                        <div><strong>Load-Matched Wiring:</strong> High-quality <a href=\"/copper-wire/\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium hover:underline\">copper wiring</a> to prevent melting during Rajkot&#8217;s high ambient temperature runs.</div>\r\n                    </li>\r\n                </ul>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"relative group\">\r\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 400\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-3