      <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"hover:underline\">Ducting Repair Rajkot</a>\r\n            <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"hover:underline\">Central AC Repair Rajkot</a>\r\n            <a href=\"/refrigerator-service-center-rajkot\" class=\"hover:underline\">Fridge Service Center Rajkot</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- PRICING TABLE -->\r\n<section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-20 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\">\r\n    <div class=\"mb-10\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900\">AC Installation &#038; Material Rate Card</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"text-gray-500\">Fixed standard rates as per our verified <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Standard Rate Card</a>.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-gray-200\">\r\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left bg-white min-w-[700px]\">\r\n            <thead class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white\">\r\n                <tr><th class=\"p-6\">Efficiency Level</th><th class=\"p-6\">3-Star Inverter</th><th class=\"p-6 text-blue-300 font-bold\">5-Star Inverter (Best for Rajkot)</th></tr>\r\n            </thead>\r\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y text-gray-600 text-sm\">\r\n                <tr><td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Annual Savings</td><td class=\"p-6\">~₹1,500/year</td><td class=\"p-6 text-green-600 font-bold\">~₹4,500/year</td></tr>\r\n                <tr><td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Cooling Speed</td><td class=\"p-6\">Standard</td><td class=\"p-6\">Turbo (15% Faster)</td></tr>\r\n                <tr><td class=\"p-6 font-semibold\">Environment Impact</td><td class=\"p-6\">Low</td><td class=\"p-6 font-bold\">Green-Tier (R32 Gas)</td></tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n        </table>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- PRE-INSTALLATION CHECKLIST -->\r\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4\">\r\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\r\n        <div class=\"bg-blue-900 rounded-[3rem] p-10 md:p-16 text-white flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center shadow-2xl\">\r\n            <div class=\"lg:w-1/2\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Rajkot Homeowner&#8217;s Pre-Installation Checklist</h2>\r\n                <p class=\"text-blue-200 mb-8 text-white\">Ensure a smooth service for your <a href=\"/split-ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-300 font-bold hover:underline\">Split AC Setup</a> in Rajkot:</p>\r\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\r\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg> 16A Dedicated Socket?</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg> Balcony/Ledge space clear?</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg> Drain pipe route ready?</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg> Societies NOC obtained?</div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"lg:w-1/2 glass-effect p-8 rounded-3xl text-gray-900 shadow-lg\">\r\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Rajkot Material Support</h3>\r\n                <p class=\"mb-6 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Industrial-grade components for <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium\">ducting repairs</a> and new split/window setups.</p>\r\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-6 text-sm\">\r\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Professional Mounting</span> <strong>Fixed Rate</strong></li>\r\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Extra <a href=\"/copper-pipe/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Copper Pipe</a></span> <strong>Standard Cost</strong></li>\r\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Heavy Duty <a href=\"/outdoor-stand/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">MS Stand</a></span> <strong>Standard Rate</strong></li>\r\n                </ul>\r\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"block w-full text-center bg-blue-600 text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg transform transition hover:-translate-y-1 text-white\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Instant Rajkot Quote</a>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- LOCAL REACH - RAJKOT SERVICE AREAS -->\r\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100\">\r\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-16 italic text-gray-900\">Serving Rajkot City &#038; Industrial Zones</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-left\">\r\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\r\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4\">Residential Areas</h3>\r\n                <div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">\r\n                    Kalavad Road, 150 Feet Ring Road, University Road, Raiya Road, Kotecha Chowk, Mavdi Road, Amin Marg, Yagnik Road, Pedak Road, Sant Kabir Road, Nana Mava, Jagnath Plot, Bhakti Nagar, Ram Krishna Nagar, Sadhu Vaswani Road, Madhavrao Scindia Road, Kothariya Road, Trikon Baug Area.\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\r\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4\">Industrial GIDC Hubs</h3>\r\n                <div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">\r\n                    Metoda GIDC, Lodhika GIDC, Aji Industrial Area, Shapar-Veraval Industrial Belt, Bhakti Nagar Industrial Estate, Rajkot Industrial Hub (Zone-1 &#038; 2), Hadamtala Industrial Area.\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- FAQ SECTION - 10 QUESTIONS -->\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\">\r\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 italic text-gray-900 text-center\">10 Critical AC Installation FAQs for Rajkot</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\r\n            <!-- FAQ 1 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\" open>\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    Is vacuuming mandatory for AC installation in Rajkot&#8217;s climate?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Absolutely. Rajkot&#8217;s dry heat causes compressors to work harder. Any residual moisture in the pipes leads to acid formation and eventual burnout. Every <a href=\"/ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Rajkot AC service</a> we perform includes mandatory 500-micron technical vacuuming.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 2 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    How long does professional installation take?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">A technical split AC setup in Rajkot typically takes 2.5 to 3 hours. This allows time for correct mounting, nitrogen leak testing, and deep vacuuming.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 3 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    Do you provide VRF/Central AC installation for Metoda GIDC factories?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes, we specialize in <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Central AC installations</a> for industrial plants and corporate offices across Metoda and Lodhika GIDC.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 4 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    What is the ideal indoor unit height for Rajkot homes?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">The indoor unit should ideally be mounted 7.5 to 8 feet from the floor to allow for proper air rotation and ease of future <a href=\"/ac-repair-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold underline\">repair</a> access.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 5 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    Do you offer a warranty on your installation work?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes, Atlas Aircon provides a 30-day workmanship guarantee. If any gas leak or vibration issue occurs within a month, our team will fix it free of charge.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 6 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    Can I reuse old copper pipes for a new Inverter AC?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">We strongly recommend new <a href=\"/copper-pipe/\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">copper piping</a> because old pipes may contain residual oil or micro-leaks that damage modern R32/R410A gas systems.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 7 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    Is a heavy-duty MS stand necessary for outdoor units?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes. A heavy-duty <a href=\"/outdoor-stand/\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">outdoor stand</a> ensures your unit is secure against Saurashtra&#8217;s high winds and reduces vibration noise in your balcony.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 8 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    Do you repair industrial chillers and deep freezers in Rajkot?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes, our Rajkot mobile teams handle industrial <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">chiller repair</a> and commercial <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">deep freezer maintenance</a>.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 9 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    What electrical wiring is required for a 1.5 Ton split AC?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">You need a dedicated 16A power socket and 2.5mm or 4mm <a href=\"/copper-wire/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">multi-strand copper wire</a> to prevent voltage drops during Rajkot&#8217;s peak power load hours.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n            <!-- FAQ 10 -->\r\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\r\n                    How often should I service my newly installed AC in Rajkot?\r\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\r\n                </summary>\r\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">To maintain efficiency, a professional <a href=\"/ac-service-rajkot\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold\">service</a> is recommended every 3 months due to the high dust levels in the Saurashtra region.</p>\r\n            </details>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\r\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 hero-gradient text-white text-center\">\r\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6\">Ready for 10/10 Cooling in Rajkot?</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10 text-white\">Experience the difference of technical precision. Trust Rajkot&#8217;s HVAC engineering experts for your home or business.</p>\r\n        <a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-blue-900 px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-2xl\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\">\r\n            <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> Book Rajkot Installation Now\r\n        </a>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n",
